 witness="Lamech was the son of Methuselah and the father of Noah. He named his son 'Noah (comfort),' saying: this one shall comfort us from our work and the toil of our hands, because of the ground the LORD has cursed. In a toilsome generation, he placed his hope on the comfort God promised.",
 follow=["Holding hope for God's comfort amid toil","Naming and resolving for the next generation in faith"],
