 witness="Nahor was Abraham's brother. He was not called out like Abram, but stayed in his own land and people, yet became the source of the family of Rebekah and Laban—the wives of Isaac and Jacob later came from his branch. God's plan is also accomplished through those who 'stayed.'",
 follow=["Faithful where he was, and used by God too","Being a link of the family's continuation and connection"],
